// FIX SHAPE (probed, not yet implemented — firing-semantics surgery,
// daylight + Eric per the aug05i lesson): under a tainted scrutinee,
// arm choice must come from the SELECTION STATE WORD, not the
// placeholder-matched pattern chain. Sketch: per-arm tainted-take
// gates and the final all-missed fail edge route to a shared
